@startuml
title Activity 17 - Budget Forecasting from Approved Requests

|Authorized User|
start
:Open Budget Forecast;
:Choose department, date range and period;
|Frontend|
:Check role and department scope;
if (Scope allowed?) then (yes)
  :GET /api/budget/forecast;
  |Backend|
  :Authenticate request;
  :Load approved purchase requests;
  :Filter by date and department;
  :Read line items and calculate totals;
  :Aggregate monthly, quarterly or yearly history;
  if (At least three periods?) then (yes)
    :Calculate three-period moving average;
    :Calculate trend and confidence;
    :Build next-period forecast;
  else (no)
    :Return history with empty forecast;
  endif
  :Return history, forecast and summary;
  |Frontend|
  :Render chart, total and confidence;
  stop
else (no)
  :Hide cross-department data;
  :Show access error;
  stop
endif
@enduml
